		(uuid "73659c3c-1ea2-5daf-ba55-692993fc32bd")
	)
	(text "for as long as POD_EN is on (firmware: off when the pods stop answering). (The discrete P-FET it replaced"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 190.5 136.46 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "6bda267e-11ab-52d4-87c9-fba560d4c56d")
	)
	(text "would have burned before the polyfuse tripped: review 2026-11-24.)"
